abstract: >
  Research repository accompanying the study "Reconstructing the
  Barcelona Exhibition of 1929 through AI-Based Generative 3D
  Reconstruction". The repository documents a comparative evaluation
  of four image-to-3D generative AI systems applied to three vanished
  pavilions of the 1929 International Exposition of Barcelona.
